### 3. Initiate JazzCash Mobile Wallet Payment (Sandbox Bypass Success Test)
# This uses the official sandbox number '03123456789' to simulate a successful MPIN entry.
# We use a real orderId found in your database: e687a20d-f523-46e6-9d59-10c7b6332370
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/jazzcash/initiate HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
    "orderId": "e687a20d-f523-46e6-9d59-10c7b6332370",
    "mobileNumber": "03123456789"
}

